+# Load-regime sweep completion criterion
+
+Complete when `LOAD-REGIME-SWEEP-2026-09-10.md` reports all requested metrics
+for both the sealed and strict margin-provisioning formulations at 4 load-only
+points, 5 rate-only points, and 3 additional joint points, using the same 8
+matched anchors per point, and the saved receipt passes the report builder's
+coverage, parity, sealed-tree, and finite-number assertions.
+
